  'HEY. HEY — YOU. EYES UP HERE.',
  'D FLAWLESS, ONE CARAT: WAS TWELVE FIVE. THIS MORNING, NINE TWO.',
  "THAT'S DOWN TWENTY-SIX POINT FOUR. IN A WEEK.",
